`check` looks at remote changes, not at the whole desired state: a removed declaration stays installed (probe 04); a first SHA pin and a pin change are not installed (probe 09: `check` on a SHA returns false even with nothing installed); a project whose only sources are untrusted gets no trust request at SessionStart (probe 05). With checkInterval 0 nothing recovers it. Code: src/hooks.ts:139-147; src/engine.ts:920-938; src/sources/git.ts:105-109. Related to k64 (layout mismatch in check) but wider: check must compare declared items/pins/trust against the lock.

